    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Explore the enigmatic Tor Eternum with up to 10 friends in this frenetic online co-op action RPG.  Customize your character as you level up, explore the halls of the tower, and overcome billions of different procedurally generated bosses.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/2de9d0f8cd0f5d4a69e3fd3f1905851a.avif?t=1737483692\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/25e412c7004a61a60fde796e2faba613.poster.avif?t=1737483692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/25e412c7004a61a60fde796e2faba613.webm?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/25e412c7004a61a60fde796e2faba613.mp4?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Join up to 10 players in this fast-paced frenetic action RPG! Face endless battle possibilities, and find unique treasures and boosts on each floor. Get stronger, master your build, and venture into the halls of a treacherous Tower filled to the brim with monsters and powerful bosses.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/f756a64ded505eb80b88064dea06dd4d.avif?t=1737483692\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/7f8fae0c756dd4e8ba68a9bd13d29915.poster.avif?t=1737483692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/7f8fae0c756dd4e8ba68a9bd13d29915.webm?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/7f8fae0c756dd4e8ba68a9bd13d29915.mp4?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Pick your fighter: Knight, Priestess, Rogue, Warlock, or Summoner. Each with different abilities and skills to ensure you have the perfect match for your playstyle.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/5b06f84c47dda54864a37af71142d737.avif?t=1737483692\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/002060e291f1c425adb4d46b2977ae6b.poster.avif?t=1737483692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/002060e291f1c425adb4d46b2977ae6b.webm?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/002060e291f1c425adb4d46b2977ae6b.mp4?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Improve your build by ascending on an intricate talent tree. Level up and unlock your path to become a paragon of your class.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/1877687e304f2f4c8ad811f47c7d6780.avif?t=1737483692\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/a83b1226f5485a3c413be8d65ac44584.poster.avif?t=1737483692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/a83b1226f5485a3c413be8d65ac44584.webm?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/a83b1226f5485a3c413be8d65ac44584.mp4?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Purchase weapons and armor from the blacksmith, upgrade relics, equip artifacts, and make sure you have all the gear you need for your next expedition in the Tower.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/11c05efaeab4dd9c484da10509eb9602.avif?t=1737483692\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/328edaf33cf1e8b108c48243bf80943f.poster.avif?t=1737483692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/328edaf33cf1e8b108c48243bf80943f.webm?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/328edaf33cf1e8b108c48243bf80943f.mp4?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Your party vs hordes of monsters: who will come out victorious? Plan in advance and be strategic, for the Tower never shows mercy.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/5d0bc7ab05be5f751c383134819e88a8.avif?t=1737483692\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/620ca5409473b5f7c74e171d3f1d9646.poster.avif?t=1737483692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/620ca5409473b5f7c74e171d3f1d9646.webm?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/620ca5409473b5f7c74e171d3f1d9646.mp4?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Face unlimited variations of randomized stage bosses on each floor, each with unique abilities and different attack patterns. Test your strength, or outsmart your opponent to overcome Tor Eternum!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/e7ef6f64f643e63350f39f260a83e4df.avif?t=1737483692\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/0e38c7f2a3af468f85c5f13a3b3b2b70.poster.avif?t=1737483692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/0e38c7f2a3af468f85c5f13a3b3b2b70.webm?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/0e38c7f2a3af468f85c5f13a3b3b2b70.mp4?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Tor Eternum will adapt to your character level to provide you with an interesting challenge. No matter how strong your hero is or how advanced your equipment is, every floor\u2019s difficulty will always be scaled to be daring.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/676d2a3bffd6f5b873f113ff94e291b7.poster.avif?t=1737483692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/676d2a3bffd6f5b873f113ff94e291b7.webm?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491460/extras/676d2a3bffd6f5b873f113ff94e291b7.mp4?t=1737483692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Don\u2019t forget to wishlist and follow us!",
